  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ccefeefa-112c-46ee-9d22-87db12f6c5d3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"379\"></p><p>這是一個讓 Mizuno 與 <strong><em>Comforts</em></strong> 相容的材質包。<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>必要模組：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/comforts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Comforts</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>所有我的 Mizuno 附加包。<br></strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno 更好的樹葉</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">非官方 Mizuno 系列</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 連接材質</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 深色模式</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 連接玻璃</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 進食動畫</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 更好的草地</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-copper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 銅製工具</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-allay-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 悅靈變種</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno 雞變種</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno 雞變種 x FA</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-fox-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 狐狸變種</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 牛變種</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 牛變種 x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 豬變種</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 豬變種 x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x 農夫樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-storage-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno x 儲物樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-crate-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno x 板條箱樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-frights-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno x 驚嚇樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x 展示樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-rustic-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x 鄉村樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-ubes-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno x 芋頭樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-vegan-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x 素食樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-comforts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Comforts</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x 手工藝品</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-farm-and-charm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno x 農場與魅力</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno x 家具系列</str